<%- include('partials/header') %>

<article class="activity">
  <h1><%= pageTitle %></h1>
  <p>Reveal each tile to discover a fact about the Coral Reef zone. Find all six!</p>

  <p id="progress" class="js-only" aria-live="polite">0 of 6 facts revealed</p>

  <div class="fact-grid" id="fact-grid">
    <div class="fact-tile-wrapper">
      <button class="fact-tile js-only" data-fact-id="1" aria-controls="fact-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Reveal coral reef fact 1">?</button>
      <p class="fact-text" id="fact-1">Coral is a living animal, not a plant - each branch is made up of thousands of tiny polyps.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fact-tile-wrapper">
      <button class="fact-tile js-only" data-fact-id="2" aria-controls="fact-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Reveal coral reef fact 2">?</button>
      <p class="fact-text" id="fact-2">Clownfish are immune to the sting of the anemones they shelter in, thanks to a protective mucus coating.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fact-tile-wrapper">
      <button class="fact-tile js-only" data-fact-id="3" aria-controls="fact-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Reveal coral reef fact 3">?</button>
      <p class="fact-text" id="fact-3">Staghorn coral can grow up to 20cm a year, making it one of the fastest-growing coral species.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fact-tile-wrapper">
      <button class="fact-tile js-only" data-fact-id="4" aria-controls="fact-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Reveal coral reef fact 4">?</button>
      <p class="fact-text" id="fact-4">Coral gets much of its colour from algae living inside its tissue, in a relationship called symbiosis.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fact-tile-wrapper">
      <button class="fact-tile js-only" data-fact-id="5" aria-controls="fact-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Reveal coral reef fact 5">?</button>
      <p class="fact-text" id="fact-5">Reef tanks like ours are kept at a steady 24-27°C to mimic tropical shallow-water conditions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fact-tile-wrapper">
      <button class="fact-tile js-only" data-fact-id="6" aria-controls="fact-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Reveal coral reef fact 6">?</button>
      <p class="fact-text" id="fact-6">A single clownfish colony can include several fish, but only one breeding female - the largest in the group.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p id="completion-message" class="success-message" role="status" hidden>
    You've found all six facts! You really know the Coral Reef zone now.
  </p>

  <p><a href="/zone/coral-reef">&larr; Back to Coral Reef</a></p>
</article>

<script src="/js/activity.js"></script>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
